Z||000002||86se/lambo||07-02-2000||01:30 AM||||if it was me i would bypass the low -pressure switch at the accumaltor (with a jumper wire) and see if the compreesor engages. If it engages you have a low freon problem, if it doesent then it electrical or the compressor.||||reg||1
